          "text": "GET  /api/health            Postgres + Redis ping\nGET  /api/school-config/public\n        school_name · school_motto\n        primary_color · logo_url\n        and nothing else\nGET  /api/verify/:code      a printed card, checked\n        against the digital original. 20 per minute.\nGET  /uploads/*             files, served outside /api\nGET  /api/docs              Swagger UI\nPOST /api/auth/login · verify-otp · resend-otp\n        refresh · request-reset · reset-password",
