          "isDeleted": false,
          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "WHERE THE TOKENS SIT.  Web keeps access_token and refresh_token in localStorage, mobile keeps\nthem in expo-secure-store. Both attach Authorization: Bearer <access> from an axios request interceptor.\nA signed in user who walks onto another role's page is bounced to their own dashboard; /messages and\n/help are the two pages open to everyone.",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontFamily": 1,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "WHERE THE TOKENS SIT.  Web keeps access_token and refresh_token in localStorage, mobile keeps\nthem in expo-secure-store. Both attach Authorization: Bearer <access> from an axios request interceptor.\nA signed in user who walks onto another role's page is bounced to their own dashboard; /messages and\n/help are the two pages open to everyone.",
          "autoResize": true,
