          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "setGlobalPrefix(\"api\", { exclude: [\"uploads/{*path}\"] })\n   a named wildcard, which Express 5 requires\nuseStaticAssets(cwd()/UPLOAD_DIR, prefix \"/uploads/\")\nhelmet({ crossOriginResourcePolicy: \"cross-origin\" })\ncompression()\nenableCors({ origin: CORS_ORIGINS.split(\",\"), credentials })\nValidationPipe { whitelist, forbidNonWhitelisted, transform }\nHttpExceptionFilter, global\nSwagger DocumentBuilder(\"Markova API\", v1, bearer) → /api/docs\nlisten(PORT ?? 3000)\n\nConfigModule.forRoot({ isGlobal })   ScheduleModule.forRoot()\nThrottlerModule.forRoot([{ ttl 60000, limit 100 }])\nRedisModule · PrismaModule · CommonModule · 15 feature modules\nAPP_GUARD = ThrottlerGuard    APP_INTERCEPTOR = AuditLogInterceptor",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 3,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "setGlobalPrefix(\"api\", { exclude: [\"uploads/{*path}\"] })\n   a named wildcard, which Express 5 requires\nuseStaticAssets(cwd()/UPLOAD_DIR, prefix \"/uploads/\")\nhelmet({ crossOriginResourcePolicy: \"cross-origin\" })\ncompression()\nenableCors({ origin: CORS_ORIGINS.split(\",\"), credentials })\nValidationPipe { whitelist, forbidNonWhitelisted, transform }\nHttpExceptionFilter, global\nSwagger DocumentBuilder(\"Markova API\", v1, bearer) → /api/docs\nlisten(PORT ?? 3000)\n\nConfigModule.forRoot({ isGlobal })   ScheduleModule.forRoot()\nThrottlerModule.forRoot([{ ttl 60000, limit 100 }])\nRedisModule · PrismaModule · CommonModule · 15 feature modules\nAPP_GUARD = ThrottlerGuard    APP_INTERCEPTOR = AuditLogInterceptor",
