          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "JwtStrategy re-reads the user from the database on every request and refuses anyone\nwhose isActive went false, so revoking somebody takes effect on their very next call\nrather than whenever their token happens to expire.",
