          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "@Cron(\"0 8 * * *\")     every day at 08:00\n   handleLibraryDueReminders()\n   → LibraryService.sendDueReminders()\n   → a message to everyone with a book due\n\n@Cron(\"0 9 * * 1\")     Mondays at 09:00\n   handleChronicAbsenteeismAlerts()\n   → AttendanceService\n        .sendChronicAbsenteeismAlerts()\n   → parents of chronically absent students",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 3,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "@Cron(\"0 8 * * *\")     every day at 08:00\n   handleLibraryDueReminders()\n   → LibraryService.sendDueReminders()\n   → a message to everyone with a book due\n\n@Cron(\"0 9 * * 1\")     Mondays at 09:00\n   handleChronicAbsenteeismAlerts()\n   → AttendanceService\n        .sendChronicAbsenteeismAlerts()\n   → parents of chronically absent students",
