          "isDeleted": false,
          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "send(dto) always writes a Notification row first, then dispatches by type:  SMS → Twilio  ·  EMAIL → SMTP  ·  PUSH → Expo\nsendBulk(dto) batches EMAIL into one transport call; SMS and PUSH stay per-user and go out in parallel\nwho calls it: chronic absence alerts · library due reminders · discipline incidents and appeal outcomes · admin broadcasts\nPOST / and POST /bulk are ADMIN only.  GET / · GET /unread · PUT /:id/read · PUT /read-all · POST /push-token are open to every role.",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 1,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "send(dto) always writes a Notification row first, then dispatches by type:  SMS → Twilio  ·  EMAIL → SMTP  ·  PUSH → Expo\nsendBulk(dto) batches EMAIL into one transport call; SMS and PUSH stay per-user and go out in parallel\nwho calls it: chronic absence alerts · library due reminders · discipline incidents and appeal outcomes · admin broadcasts\nPOST / and POST /bulk are ADMIN only.  GET / · GET /unread · PUT /:id/read · PUT /read-all · POST /push-token are open to every role.",
          "autoResize": true,
          "lineHeight": 1.25
        }
      ]
