          "versionNonce": 1585219328,
          "isDeleted": false,
          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "YEARS       GET /years [all] · GET /years/:id [all]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            only one year may be isCurrent, dates validated\nTERMS       GET /terms [all] · GET /terms/:id [all]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            POST /terms/:id/close  → isClosed, locks marks\n            POST /terms/:id/reopen\nLEVELS      GET /class-levels [ADMIN,TEACHER]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            name + order + stage (O_LEVEL | A_LEVEL)\nTRADES      GET /trades [all] · POST · PUT · DELETE [ADMIN]\n            e.g. SWD, Software Development, with its sector\nSECTIONS    GET /sections [ADMIN,TEACHER]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            unique (classLevelId, tradeId, name). NULL tradeId\n            duplicates are caught again in AcademicService,\n            because Postgres treats NULLs as distinct.\nSUBJECTS    GET /subjects [ADMIN,TEACHER]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            scope O_CORE|O_ELECTIVE|A_GENERAL|A_SPECIFIC\nASSESSMENT  GET /assessment-types [ADMIN,TEACHER]\n  TYPES     POST · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            CAT 1 · CAT 2 · Practical · End of Term Exam\nLOADS       GET /assignments [ADMIN,TEACHER]\n            POST · POST /bulk · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            = TeacherSubjectClass, teacher x subject x\n            section x year\nTIMETABLE   GET /timetable [ADMIN,TEACHER,PARENT,STUDENT]\n            GET /timetable/teacher/:teacherId\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id · POST /bulk\n            dayOfWeek 1-7, startTime/endTime strings, room\nEXAMS       GET /exams [ADMIN,TEACHER,PARENT,STUDENT]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id · POST /bulk\nPROMOTION   POST /promote/preview [ADMIN]\n              a recommendation per student from\n              passThreshold 50 + disciplineThreshold 50,\n              falling back to raw mark averages when no\n              YearResult has been computed yet\n            POST /promote/commit  applies the decisions\n            POST /promote         direct bulk promote",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 3,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "YEARS       GET /years [all] · GET /years/:id [all]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            only one year may be isCurrent, dates validated\nTERMS       GET /terms [all] · GET /terms/:id [all]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            POST /terms/:id/close  → isClosed, locks marks\n            POST /terms/:id/reopen\nLEVELS      GET /class-levels [ADMIN,TEACHER]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            name + order + stage (O_LEVEL | A_LEVEL)\nTRADES      GET /trades [all] · POST · PUT · DELETE [ADMIN]\n            e.g. SWD, Software Development, with its sector\nSECTIONS    GET /sections [ADMIN,TEACHER]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            unique (classLevelId, tradeId, name). NULL tradeId\n            duplicates are caught again in AcademicService,\n            because Postgres treats NULLs as distinct.\nSUBJECTS    GET /subjects [ADMIN,TEACHER]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            scope O_CORE|O_ELECTIVE|A_GENERAL|A_SPECIFIC\nASSESSMENT  GET /assessment-types [ADMIN,TEACHER]\n  TYPES     POST · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            CAT 1 · CAT 2 · Practical · End of Term Exam\nLOADS       GET /assignments [ADMIN,TEACHER]\n            POST · POST /bulk · DELETE /:id  [ADMIN]\n            = TeacherSubjectClass, teacher x subject x\n            section x year\nTIMETABLE   GET /timetable [ADMIN,TEACHER,PARENT,STUDENT]\n            GET /timetable/teacher/:teacherId\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id · POST /bulk\n            dayOfWeek 1-7, startTime/endTime strings, room\nEXAMS       GET /exams [ADMIN,TEACHER,PARENT,STUDENT]\n            POST · PUT /:id · DELETE /:id · POST /bulk\nPROMOTION   POST /promote/preview [ADMIN]\n              a recommendation per student from\n              passThreshold 50 + disciplineThreshold 50,\n              falling back to raw mark averages when no\n              YearResult has been computed yet\n            POST /promote/commit  applies the decisions\n            POST /promote         direct bulk promote",
          "autoResize": true,
          "lineHeight": 1.25
        }
      ]
