      "text": "BOOKS\nPOST /books · POST /books/bulk      [ADMIN,LIBRARIAN]\nGET  /books · GET /books/:id  [+STUDENT,TEACHER]\nPUT  /books/:id · DELETE /books/:id [ADMIN,LIBRARIAN]\n   title · author · isbn · category · quantity\n   availableCount · barcode · shelfLocation\n   replacementCost · isActive\n\nLOANS\nPOST /checkout   decrements stock, sets dueDate\nPOST /return     RETURNED, puts the copy back\nPOST /lost       LOST, charges replacementCost\nGET  /loans/active · /loans/overdue · /loans/reminders\nGET  /loans/my            [STUDENT,TEACHER] my own\nPOST /reminders/send      [ADMIN] runs the 8am job now\n   ACTIVE · RETURNED · OVERDUE · LOST · DAMAGED\n\nGET  /analytics  most borrowed, overdue rate, stock",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "BOOKS\nPOST /books · POST /books/bulk      [ADMIN,LIBRARIAN]\nGET  /books · GET /books/:id  [+STUDENT,TEACHER]\nPUT  /books/:id · DELETE /books/:id [ADMIN,LIBRARIAN]\n   title · author · isbn · category · quantity\n   availableCount · barcode · shelfLocation\n   replacementCost · isActive\n\nLOANS\nPOST /checkout   decrements stock, sets dueDate\nPOST /return     RETURNED, puts the copy back\nPOST /lost       LOST, charges replacementCost\nGET  /loans/active · /loans/overdue · /loans/reminders\nGET  /loans/my            [STUDENT,TEACHER] my own\nPOST /reminders/send      [ADMIN] runs the 8am job now\n   ACTIVE · RETURNED · OVERDUE · LOST · DAMAGED\n\nGET  /analytics  most borrowed, overdue rate, stock",
