          "version": 1,
          "versionNonce": 1113869312,
          "isDeleted": false,
          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "REPORT CARDS\nGET  /term/:studentId          JSON data   [4 roles]\nGET  /term/:studentId/html     the A4 layout\nGET  /term/:studentId/pdf      puppeteer-core → PDF\nPOST /term/class      [ADMIN] a whole section, one PDF\nGET  /year/:studentId          [4 roles]\n\nDOCUMENTS   POST /document [ADMIN], DocumentType:\n   transfer_letter · enrollment_confirmation\n   discipline_report · transcript\n\nID CARDS   Student.nfcCardId + cardIssuedAt\nGET  /id-card/:studentId · POST /id-cards/bulk\nGET  /id-cards/registry  · POST /id-cards/issue\nPOST /id-cards/issue-bulk · POST /id-cards/revoke\n   issue mints a unique card id and retries on a clash.\n   issue-bulk covers every ACTIVE student in a section\n   who has no card. revoke nulls the id and the date.\n\nEXPORT\nGET  /export/dataset/:key  [ADMIN] streamed CSV of\n     users · students · teachers · marks · attendance\nGET  /export/all           [ADMIN] every table as a ZIP,\n     with passwordHash stripped out",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 3,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "REPORT CARDS\nGET  /term/:studentId          JSON data   [4 roles]\nGET  /term/:studentId/html     the A4 layout\nGET  /term/:studentId/pdf      puppeteer-core → PDF\nPOST /term/class      [ADMIN] a whole section, one PDF\nGET  /year/:studentId          [4 roles]\n\nDOCUMENTS   POST /document [ADMIN], DocumentType:\n   transfer_letter · enrollment_confirmation\n   discipline_report · transcript\n\nID CARDS   Student.nfcCardId + cardIssuedAt\nGET  /id-card/:studentId · POST /id-cards/bulk\nGET  /id-cards/registry  · POST /id-cards/issue\nPOST /id-cards/issue-bulk · POST /id-cards/revoke\n   issue mints a unique card id and retries on a clash.\n   issue-bulk covers every ACTIVE student in a section\n   who has no card. revoke nulls the id and the date.\n\nEXPORT\nGET  /export/dataset/:key  [ADMIN] streamed CSV of\n     users · students · teachers · marks · attendance\nGET  /export/all           [ADMIN] every table as a ZIP,\n     with passwordHash stripped out",
          "autoResize": true,
          "lineHeight": 1.25
        }
