      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FOR THE ADMIN  [ADMIN]\nGET /admin/dashboard            headline counts, KPIs\nGET /admin/performance-trends   ?academicYearId\nGET /admin/class-comparisons    ?termId\nGET /admin/discipline           ?academicYearId\nGET /admin/library\nGET /admin/attendance           ?termId\nGET /admin/grade-distribution   ?termId\nGET /admin/enrollment           by level, male / female\n\nFOR ONE PERSON\nGET /student/:studentId/profile   [4 roles]\nGET /student/:studentId  ?termId  [4 roles]\nGET /teacher/class/:classSectionId  [TEACHER] own only\nGET /parent/child/:studentId/trends [PARENT] linked only\n\ncached at analytics:<view>:<scope>, EX 60. Best effort:\nif Redis is down it computes live rather than failing.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
