          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "POST /login            PUBLIC  password, then OTP or tokens\nPOST /verify-otp       PUBLIC  sessionId + otp → tokens\nPOST /resend-otp       PUBLIC  30 s cooldown per session\nPOST /refresh          PUBLIC  rotates. replay kills the session\nPOST /request-reset    PUBLIC  emails a reset link\nPOST /reset-password   PUBLIC  token + a new password\nPOST /change-password  JWT     clears forcePasswordChange\nPOST /logout           JWT     deactivates the session row\nGET  /sessions         JWT     device, IP, expiry\nGET  /profile          JWT     me, with the role joins\nPATCH /profile         JWT     edit your own",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 3,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "POST /login            PUBLIC  password, then OTP or tokens\nPOST /verify-otp       PUBLIC  sessionId + otp → tokens\nPOST /resend-otp       PUBLIC  30 s cooldown per session\nPOST /refresh          PUBLIC  rotates. replay kills the session\nPOST /request-reset    PUBLIC  emails a reset link\nPOST /reset-password   PUBLIC  token + a new password\nPOST /change-password  JWT     clears forcePasswordChange\nPOST /logout           JWT     deactivates the session row\nGET  /sessions         JWT     device, IP, expiry\nGET  /profile          JWT     me, with the role joins\nPATCH /profile         JWT     edit your own",
