          "versionNonce": 1062011136,
          "isDeleted": false,
          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "GET  /              [ADMIN] the paginated directory\nGET  /:id           [all roles] self and permitted lookups\nPOST /              [ADMIN] creates the User and, where the\n     role calls for it, the Student or Teacher record too.\n     Role code TCH/PAR/LIB/ADM. Students carry STD on\n     studentIdNumber instead. NIDA nationalId validated,\n     a temp password generated, forcePasswordChange set.\nPUT  /:id           [ADMIN]\nDELETE /:id         [ADMIN] SOFT: isActive goes false\nPOST /:id/photo     [all roles] multer → /uploads, photoUrl\nPOST /bulk-import   [ADMIN] a CSV of users\nGET  /import-template/:role  [ADMIN] the CSV to fill in",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 3,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "GET  /              [ADMIN] the paginated directory\nGET  /:id           [all roles] self and permitted lookups\nPOST /              [ADMIN] creates the User and, where the\n     role calls for it, the Student or Teacher record too.\n     Role code TCH/PAR/LIB/ADM. Students carry STD on\n     studentIdNumber instead. NIDA nationalId validated,\n     a temp password generated, forcePasswordChange set.\nPUT  /:id           [ADMIN]\nDELETE /:id         [ADMIN] SOFT: isActive goes false\nPOST /:id/photo     [all roles] multer → /uploads, photoUrl\nPOST /bulk-import   [ADMIN] a CSV of users\nGET  /import-template/:role  [ADMIN] the CSV to fill in",
          "autoResize": true,
          "lineHeight": 1.25
        }
      ]
