          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "POST /            [ADMIN] one, typed SMS | EMAIL | PUSH\nPOST /bulk        [ADMIN] many. EMAIL batches, the rest\n                  go out per user, in parallel\nGET  /            [all roles] mine, 50 at a time\nGET  /unread      [all roles] the count\nPUT  /:id/read · PUT /read-all   [all roles]\nPOST /push-token  [all roles] an Expo token, ios | android\n\nevery one is written to the table before it is sent",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 3,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "POST /            [ADMIN] one, typed SMS | EMAIL | PUSH\nPOST /bulk        [ADMIN] many. EMAIL batches, the rest\n                  go out per user, in parallel\nGET  /            [all roles] mine, 50 at a time\nGET  /unread      [all roles] the count\nPUT  /:id/read · PUT /read-all   [all roles]\nPOST /push-token  [all roles] an Expo token, ios | android\n\nevery one is written to the table before it is sent",
