          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "UPLOADS.  multer plus src/common/file-validation.ts guard the three upload paths: user photos, the branding\nassets (logo, stamp, signature) and the attachments hung off homework, appeals, messages and support tickets.\nEverything lands in UPLOAD_DIR, default ./uploads, and is served from /uploads/… which sits deliberately\noutside the /api prefix, using the Express 5 named wildcard exclusion.",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontFamily": 1,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "UPLOADS.  multer plus src/common/file-validation.ts guard the three upload paths: user photos, the branding\nassets (logo, stamp, signature) and the attachments hung off homework, appeals, messages and support tickets.\nEverything lands in UPLOAD_DIR, default ./uploads, and is served from /uploads/… which sits deliberately\noutside the /api prefix, using the Express 5 named wildcard exclusion.",
          "autoResize": true,
          "lineHeight": 1.25
        }
      ]
    },
