          "frameId": null,
          "roundness": null,
          "seed": 623187456,
          "version": 1,
          "versionNonce": 561942016,
          "isDeleted": false,
          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "READ THE ROLE TAGS CAREFULLY.\n[ADMIN] on a write endpoint and [4 roles] on the matching read is the\npattern almost everywhere: anybody may look at their own slice, only an\nadmin may change the shared record. The two exceptions worth knowing are\nPOST /homework/submit, which only a STUDENT may call, and POST\n/discipline/appeals, which only a PARENT or STUDENT may call.",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontFamily": 1,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "READ THE ROLE TAGS CAREFULLY.\n[ADMIN] on a write endpoint and [4 roles] on the matching read is the\npattern almost everywhere: anybody may look at their own slice, only an\nadmin may change the shared record. The two exceptions worth knowing are\nPOST /homework/submit, which only a STUDENT may call, and POST\n/discipline/appeals, which only a PARENT or STUDENT may call.",
          "autoResize": true,
          "lineHeight": 1.25
        }
      ]
    },
