          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "Prisma 6, schema at backend/prisma/schema.prisma\n38 models · 17 enums · snake_case @@map table names\n14 migrations, from init through to staff_gender_dob,\n   including a payments module that was added and then\n   removed again a day later. There is no billing here.\nPrismaService is injected straight into every service,\n   with no repository layer in between.",
