          "seed": 1778695168,
          "version": 1,
          "versionNonce": 2102148096,
          "isDeleted": false,
          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "THE SEED IS PART OF THE PRODUCT.  prisma/seed.ts builds a whole Rwandan school:\nKinyarwanda names that are gendered and not inherited, +250 MTN and Airtel numbers,\n@markova.edu addresses, NIDA shaped national IDs, the real five level address down to\nvillage, O-Level S1 to S3 in streams, A-Level levels 3 to 5 across four trades.\nEvery date is derived from now, so a reseed always looks like today.\nIt also truncates user_sessions, which logs every single person out.",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontFamily": 1,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "THE SEED IS PART OF THE PRODUCT.  prisma/seed.ts builds a whole Rwandan school:\nKinyarwanda names that are gendered and not inherited, +250 MTN and Airtel numbers,\n@markova.edu addresses, NIDA shaped national IDs, the real five level address down to\nvillage, O-Level S1 to S3 in streams, A-Level levels 3 to 5 across four trades.\nEvery date is derived from now, so a reseed always looks like today.\nIt also truncates user_sessions, which logs every single person out.",
          "autoResize": true,
          "lineHeight": 1.25
        }
      ]
    },
