          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "80 and up    A    6 pts    Excellent\n75 to 79     B    5 pts    Very Good\n70 to 74     C    4 pts    Good\n65 to 69     D    3 pts    Satisfactory\n60 to 64     E    2 pts    Adequate\n50 to 59     S    1 pt     Fair\nunder 50     F    0 pts    Fail",
          "autoResize": true,
          "lineHeight": 1.25
        }
      ]
