          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "scaleFor(scope)           ELECTIVE_SCALE only for O_ELECTIVE, CORE_SCALE for the rest\ngradeFor(scope, pct)      { min, letter, points, remark }\ncomputeSubjectTotal(...)  the weighted percentage for one subject\noverallGrade(avgPct)      the single letter printed for the whole term\ncountsTowardAggregate()   which subjects feed the aggregate at all\nMAX_POINTS_PER_SUBJECT 6  so aggregateMax = 6 x the counted subjects\nCOMPETENCE_THRESHOLD 70   competenceFor(practical): COMPETENT | NOT_YET_COMPETENT\n\nused by  MarksService.calculateTermResults → letterGrade, aggregate, rank\n         MarksService.calculateYearResults → yearlyAverage, rank, isPromoted\n         ReportsService when it renders a card, AcademicService on promotion",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontFamily": 3,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "scaleFor(scope)           ELECTIVE_SCALE only for O_ELECTIVE, CORE_SCALE for the rest\ngradeFor(scope, pct)      { min, letter, points, remark }\ncomputeSubjectTotal(...)  the weighted percentage for one subject\noverallGrade(avgPct)      the single letter printed for the whole term\ncountsTowardAggregate()   which subjects feed the aggregate at all\nMAX_POINTS_PER_SUBJECT 6  so aggregateMax = 6 x the counted subjects\nCOMPETENCE_THRESHOLD 70   competenceFor(practical): COMPETENT | NOT_YET_COMPETENT\n\nused by  MarksService.calculateTermResults → letterGrade, aggregate, rank\n         MarksService.calculateYearResults → yearlyAverage, rank, isPromoted\n         ReportsService when it renders a card, AcademicService on promotion",
          "autoResize": true,
          "lineHeight": 1.25
        }
      ]
    },
