          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "EducationStage    O_LEVEL, Senior 1 to 3 in streams A and B, with no trade\n                  A_LEVEL, TVET levels 3 to 5, and every level runs the trades\nSubjectScope      O_CORE and O_ELECTIVE at O-Level. A_GENERAL for shared modules\n                  and A_SPECIFIC for the trade modules, per the RTB and NESA standards\nTrade             a code, a name and a national sector. SWD, Software Development,\n                  under ICT and Multimedia. O-Level sections carry tradeId = null.",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontFamily": 1,
          "textAlign": "left",
