          "versionNonce": 446244864,
          "isDeleted": false,
          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "WEB     localStorage: access_token, refresh_token\n        IndexedDB \"markova-offline\" v1, holding marks\n        typed while the network was gone\n        Zustand: auth-store · brand-store · chat-store\n\nMOBILE  expo-secure-store: the two tokens\n        react-native-mmkv: cache and the attendance\n        queue at markova:attendance-queue, replayed by\n        processQueue(). Network errors and 5xx retry,\n        anything else is dropped on the floor.\n        Zustand: auth-store · chat-store",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 1,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "WEB     localStorage: access_token, refresh_token\n        IndexedDB \"markova-offline\" v1, holding marks\n        typed while the network was gone\n        Zustand: auth-store · brand-store · chat-store\n\nMOBILE  expo-secure-store: the two tokens\n        react-native-mmkv: cache and the attendance\n        queue at markova:attendance-queue, replayed by\n        processQueue(). Network errors and 5xx retry,\n        anything else is dropped on the floor.\n        Zustand: auth-store · chat-store",
