          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "AcademicYear → TeacherSubjectClass, YearResult\nTerm → TermResult, DisciplineIncident, Homework, ExamSchedule\nClassLevel → Subject          Trade → Subject\nClassSection → Timetable, TeacherSubjectClass, Mark, TermResult, YearResult,\n   Attendance, Homework, ExamSchedule\nSubject → Timetable, TeacherSubjectClass, Attendance, Homework, ExamSchedule\nTeacher → TeacherRole, Timetable, Mark, TeacherAttendance, Homework\nStudent → Attendance, DisciplineIncident, HomeworkSubmission, TermResult, YearResult\nUser → UserSession, AuditLog, Attendance (markedBy), DisciplineIncident (recordedBy),\n   DisciplineAppeal (submittedBy and reviewedBy), BookLoan (borrower),\n   HomeworkSubmission (gradedBy), Conversation (createdBy), ConversationParticipant,\n   Message (sender), MessageRead, Notification, PushToken, SupportTicket\nDisciplineIncident → DisciplineAppeal      Book → BookLoan\nHomework → HomeworkSubmission              Conversation → participants, messages\nMessage → MessageRead\n\nON DELETE  Cascade nearly everywhere. Restrict on Trade → Section and Trade → Subject,\nso you cannot delete a trade out from under a class. SetNull on AuditLog.userId and on\nAttendance.subjectId. SchoolConfig and FaqArticle stand alone with no relations at all.",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 1,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "AcademicYear → TeacherSubjectClass, YearResult\nTerm → TermResult, DisciplineIncident, Homework, ExamSchedule\nClassLevel → Subject          Trade → Subject\nClassSection → Timetable, TeacherSubjectClass, Mark, TermResult, YearResult,\n   Attendance, Homework, ExamSchedule\nSubject → Timetable, TeacherSubjectClass, Attendance, Homework, ExamSchedule\nTeacher → TeacherRole, Timetable, Mark, TeacherAttendance, Homework\nStudent → Attendance, DisciplineIncident, HomeworkSubmission, TermResult, YearResult\nUser → UserSession, AuditLog, Attendance (markedBy), DisciplineIncident (recordedBy),\n   DisciplineAppeal (submittedBy and reviewedBy), BookLoan (borrower),\n   HomeworkSubmission (gradedBy), Conversation (createdBy), ConversationParticipant,\n   Message (sender), MessageRead, Notification, PushToken, SupportTicket\nDisciplineIncident → DisciplineAppeal      Book → BookLoan\nHomework → HomeworkSubmission              Conversation → participants, messages\nMessage → MessageRead\n\nON DELETE  Cascade nearly everywhere. Restrict on Trade → Section and Trade → Subject,\nso you cannot delete a trade out from under a class. SetNull on AuditLog.userId and on\nAttendance.subjectId. SchoolConfig and FaqArticle stand alone with no relations at all.",
