          "text": "docker-compose up -d       postgres :5434 · redis :6380\n                           note the non default ports\n\nbackend/  cp ../.env.example .env  ·  npm install\n          npx prisma migrate dev  ·  npx prisma db seed\n          npm run start:dev     → :3000, /api, /api/docs\n          npm run lint · npm test · npm run test:e2e\n          check types with npx tsc --noEmit, never a build,\n          because the nest watcher owns dist/\n\nweb/      npm install · npm run dev   → :3001, not 3000\n          npm run build · npm run lint · npx vitest\n          e2e: WEB=… API=… node web/e2e/ui-audit.spec.js\n\nmobile/   npm install · npm start   → Expo, then i / a / w",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 3,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "docker-compose up -d       postgres :5434 · redis :6380\n                           note the non default ports\n\nbackend/  cp ../.env.example .env  ·  npm install\n          npx prisma migrate dev  ·  npx prisma db seed\n          npm run start:dev     → :3000, /api, /api/docs\n          npm run lint · npm test · npm run test:e2e\n          check types with npx tsc --noEmit, never a build,\n          because the nest watcher owns dist/\n\nweb/      npm install · npm run dev   → :3001, not 3000\n          npm run build · npm run lint · npx vitest\n          e2e: WEB=… API=… node web/e2e/ui-audit.spec.js\n\nmobile/   npm install · npm start   → Expo, then i / a / w",
