          "versionNonce": 1333440512,
          "isDeleted": false,
          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "ci.yml   on push to master and to audit/ feat/ fix/,\n         and on every pull request\n  backend  node 22 · npm ci --legacy-peer-deps, because\n           @nestjs/schedule@4 predates Nest 11 peer ranges\n           prisma generate · tsc --noEmit · jest\n  web      node 22 · npm ci · tsc --noEmit · vitest run\n           next build\n\ndeploy.yml  workflow_dispatch, staging or production\n  backend  docker build ./backend →\n             ghcr.io/<repo>/backend:{latest|staging} + :<sha>\n           ssh → /opt/markova → compose pull && up -d\n           prisma migrate deploy\n           curl -f /api/health, twice, as the gate\n  mobile   node 20 · expo-github-action · eas build all\n           production also runs eas submit\n\nsecrets  PROD_HOST · STAGING_HOST · DEPLOY_USER\n         DEPLOY_SSH_KEY · PROD_URL · STAGING_URL · EXPO_TOKEN",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontFamily": 3,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "ci.yml   on push to master and to audit/ feat/ fix/,\n         and on every pull request\n  backend  node 22 · npm ci --legacy-peer-deps, because\n           @nestjs/schedule@4 predates Nest 11 peer ranges\n           prisma generate · tsc --noEmit · jest\n  web      node 22 · npm ci · tsc --noEmit · vitest run\n           next build\n\ndeploy.yml  workflow_dispatch, staging or production\n  backend  docker build ./backend →\n             ghcr.io/<repo>/backend:{latest|staging} + :<sha>\n           ssh → /opt/markova → compose pull && up -d\n           prisma migrate deploy\n           curl -f /api/health, twice, as the gate\n  mobile   node 20 · expo-github-action · eas build all\n           production also runs eas submit\n\nsecrets  PROD_HOST · STAGING_HOST · DEPLOY_USER\n         DEPLOY_SSH_KEY · PROD_URL · STAGING_URL · EXPO_TOKEN",
          "autoResize": true,
          "lineHeight": 1.25
        }
      ]
    },
