          "text": "core     DATABASE_URL · REDIS_URL · PORT, default 3000\n         NODE_ENV · UPLOAD_DIR, default ./uploads\n         CORS_ORIGINS, comma separated,\n           defaulting to http://localhost:3000\nauth     JWT_SECRET, and the app refuses to boot without it\n         JWT_REFRESH_SECRET\nemail    SMTP_HOST · SMTP_PORT · SMTP_USER · SMTP_PASS\n         SMTP_FROM · SMTP_FROM_NAME\nsms      TWILIO_SID · TWILIO_TOKEN · TWILIO_SENDER_ID\nlinks    APP_URL · WEB_URL, for verification and reset links\npdf      CHROME_PATH, since puppeteer-core ships no browser\nerrors   SENTRY_DSN\nweb      NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL, default localhost:3000/api\nmobile   the expo config extra block: apiUrl · wsUrl",
