          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "DOS, HOD and CLASS_TEACHER live on the\nTeacherRole table and RolesGuard never looks at\nthem. Any enforcement has to be written by hand,\ninside a service, every time.",
