          "boundElements": null,
          "updated": 1,
          "link": null,
          "locked": false,
          "text": "puppeteer-core ships without Chromium on purpose,\nso CHROME_PATH has to point at an installed Chrome\nin every environment that renders a report card.\nNo Chrome, no PDFs.",
