          "textAlign": "left",
          "verticalAlign": "top",
          "containerId": null,
          "originalText": "puppeteer-core ships without Chromium on purpose,\nso CHROME_PATH has to point at an installed Chrome\nin every environment that renders a report card.\nNo Chrome, no PDFs.",
